agent-def/AgentContext/evalId:
The eval ID of the current Attempt. The NiceEval Runner always fills it from the Eval identity after discovery;
third parties constructing AgentContext directly can omit it. An Adapter can use it to locate read-only host assets in the same directory as the task,
but must not use it to bypass the Sandbox's hidden-criteria isolation.

experiment-fields/judge:
This Experiment's Judge execution configuration. It overrides only the model / endpoint / credential selector / call budget;
the rubric is owned by the Match, and the material and consumption threshold come from the Assertion. Each field resolves in the order
Experiment → Eval → Config → built-in default.
